# 🚀 AWS Serverless Employee CRUD API using Terraform

![AWS](https://img.shields.io/badge/AWS-Serverless-orange)
![Terraform](https://img.shields.io/badge/Terraform-IaC-purple)
![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.12-blue)
![Jenkins](https://img.shields.io/badge/Jenkins-CI%2FCD-red)
![API Gateway](https://img.shields.io/badge/API-Gateway-green)
![DynamoDB](https://img.shields.io/badge/DynamoDB-NoSQL-blue)

## 📖 Overview

This project demonstrates how to build a **production-style serverless REST API** on AWS using **Terraform** and **Python**.

The infrastructure is completely automated using **Infrastructure as Code (IaC)**, while the deployment process is automated using **Jenkins CI/CD**.

The application allows users to perform CRUD (Create, Read, Update, Delete) operations on employee records stored in **Amazon DynamoDB**.

---

# 🏗 Architecture

```
                  GitHub
                     │
                     ▼
               Jenkins Pipeline
                     │
                     ▼
              Terraform Deploy
                     │
                     ▼
              Amazon API Gateway
                     │
                     ▼
               AWS Lambda (Python)
                     │
                     ▼
               Amazon DynamoDB
                     │
         ┌───────────┴────────────┐
         ▼                        ▼
   CloudWatch Logs           SNS Alerts
```

