# 🛠 Troubleshooting

## Error

```
{"message":"Not Found"}
```

### Cause

The API Gateway route was not called correctly.

### Solution

Use the correct endpoint:

```
https://<api-id>.execute-api.<region>.amazonaws.com/employee
```

---

## Error

```
pytest: command not found
```

### Cause

Pytest was not installed on the Jenkins server.

### Solution

Install pytest or remove the testing stage if no unit tests are available.

---

## Error

```
No valid credential sources found
```

### Cause

AWS CLI credentials were not configured.

### Solution

```bash
aws configure
```

---

## Error

```
Unable to find Jenkins-destroy-ci/Jenkinsfile
```

### Cause

The Jenkins Script Path did not match the repository structure.

### Solution

Ensure the pipeline Script Path is:

```
Jenkins-destroy-ci/Jenkinsfile
```

